+- [Decisions](adrs/README.md) own the context, options, choice and consequences of foundational decisions whose
+  reversal affects more than one feature or module. A product choice alone stays with the behavior it implements;
+  a record names the product and why it implements the broader decision.
+- [Features](features/README.md) own the current behavior of each product feature, with sections following that
+  behavior and links to the decisions that shaped it.
+- [Runbooks](runbooks/README.md) own procedures for an operational trigger: prerequisites, steps with expected
+  results, and what to do if they fail.
+- [Glossary](glossary.md) owns shared terms and the synonyms to avoid.
